## Competency Taxonomy

A fixed but extensible set of tags applied to both user achievements and golden examples:

| Tag | Description |
|---|---|
| `strategic_problem_solving` | Structuring ambiguous problems, frameworks, recommendations |
| `product_technical_execution` | Building things, shipping features, technical depth |
| `sustainability_impact` | ESG, sustainability consulting, social impact |
| `financial_quantitative_rigor` | Modeling, analysis, numbers-driven work |
| `leadership_stakeholder_mgmt` | Managing people, driving initiatives, cross-functional work |
| `entrepreneurial_ownership` | Founding, building 0-to-1, independent execution |

These tags are auto-classified by the AI during extraction and editable by the user.

